			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Bump to Node 24 across build pipeline and documentation\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to 412bc461, which advances twelve submodules for dependency synchronization and documentation formatting. The primary change across Land is a Node version migration from v22 to v24 required by the VS Code Editor submodule.\n\n**Dependency Updates (Element)**:\n- **Common**: Bump @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260526.1 → 4.20260529.1\n- **Echo**: Update @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260528.1 → 4.20260529.1, wrangler 4.94.0 → 4.95.0\n- **Sky**: Upgrade Astro 6.3.8 → 6.4.2\n- **Rest**: Bump minimum Node.js requirement from v18 to v24\n- **Grove/Vine/Mountain**: Documentation table formatting corrections\n\n**Land Build Pipeline (Major Change)**:\n- **Documentation**: Update Building.md and BuildPipeline.md to require Node 24 instead of v22. Added explicit .nvmrc references and `dum` command substitution for `npm run`.\n- **Maintain Scripts**: Replace all NODE_VERSION=22 references with NODE_VERSION=24 across Maintain/Debug/Build.sh, Maintain/Debug/Run.sh, Maintain/Release/Build.sh, and Maintain/Integration/SmokeProfiles.sh\n- **Binary/Naming**: Update binary and bundle names in SmokeProfiles.sh to use \"24NodeVersion\" instead of \"22NodeVersion\"\n- **Sample Config**: Update .env.Land.Node.Sample examples to reflect Node 24 paths (Node@24, v24.15.0)\n- **package.json**: Bump devDependencies: @biomejs/biome 2.4.15 → 2.4.16, @vue/compiler-sfc 3.5.34 → 3.5.35, prettier-plugin-java 2.9.4 → 2.9.7, turbo 2.9.14 → 2.9.16\n\n**Motivation**: The VS Code Editor submodule (Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor) now requires Node 24 for compilation. This change synchronizes all build scripts, documentation, and environment configurations to use Node v24.15.0 as the canonical development version.\n\n**Scope**: This is a coordinated infrastructure update. No functional behavior changes except Rest's minimum Node requirement bump. All build artifacts will carry the \"24NodeVersion\" tag moving forward.\n\nRefs: 412bc4612800a4e755373accf9c938c563d0c928",
